growth company <span id="xdx_902_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20251201__20251201_z56u9iFPr9fb"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-12-01" format="ixt:booleantrue" id="Fact000033" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9746;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

