with any new or revised financial accounting standards provided pursuant to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act. <span id="xdx_904_edei--EntityExTransitionPeriod_c20251201__20251201_ze0zz9UQi6X5"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-12-01" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000034" name="dei:EntityExTransitionPeriod">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

